# The native library is NOT tracked. `buildCoreJniDebug` and
# `buildCoreJniRelease` compile it from the core at the repository root, so the
# binary always matches the sources in this commit. `app/src/main/jniLibs` is
# not read at all; the generated layout goes to
# `app/build/generated/coreJniLibs/{debug,release}`.
